%% AstraNotes - Activity Diagram
%% Workflow: "Create a private note" - exercises ValidationLayer, PrivacyService,
%% JsonFileRepository, and the SPR-02 error-translation gate. Method names match
%% class-diagram.mmd exactly.

flowchart TD
    Start([User invokes 'create note' from GUI]) --> Collect[GUI view collects title, body, is_private=true, tags<br/>NotesController forwards to NoteManager]
    Collect --> Build[NoteManager.create_note builds Note dataclass<br/>id=uuid4, created_at=modified_at=now UTC]
    Build --> Validate{ValidationLayer.validate<br/>title non-empty?}

    Validate -- no --> RaiseV[Raise ValidationError - FR-01]
    RaiseV --> Surface1[GUI status bar shows user-friendly message - SPR-02]
    Surface1 --> End([End])

    Validate -- yes --> PrivacyCheck{is_private?}
    PrivacyCheck -- yes --> Encrypt[PrivacyService.encrypt body<br/>returns Fernet ciphertext bytes - SPR-01]
    PrivacyCheck -- no --> KeepPlain[body kept as plaintext str]

    Encrypt --> Save
    KeepPlain --> Save["NoteRepository.save<br/>JsonFileRepository writes data_dir/{id}.json"]

    Save --> WriteOk{Write succeeded?}
    WriteOk -- no --> RaiseP[Catch OSError, raise PersistenceError - SPR-02]
    RaiseP --> Surface2[GUI status bar shows user-friendly message<br/>no file paths or stack traces]
    Surface2 --> End

    WriteOk -- yes --> Return[Return saved Note to caller]
    Return --> Confirm[GUI clears editor, refreshes list, shows 'Saved note' + id]
    Confirm --> End
